Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 4,
  "amount": 10
}

### 7. null в параметре  amount
POST {{host}}{{apiV1}}accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "accountId": 4,
  "amount": null
}


### 8. Строка в параметре  amount
